t  we are providing public money as I said  private money has to come too we're  working very closely together to create  the conducive regulatory environment  with the African medicines Agency for  example and of course the main goal is  to have this vaccine manufacturing  capacities working to bring skills to  the region so to have the skilled  personnel and that is the difference of  global gateway com compared to others  who come with infrastructure projects  there's transparency there's good  governance there is the absolute goal to  have locally an added value in skills in  manufacturing capacity that is produced  there or for example transport corridors  that are established so that it brings  work to the region and high quality  um we have different  strategic topics where we are investing  in I mentioned already the health topic  of course the connectivity the transport  routes but also the digital connectivity  plays an enormous role of course energy  and here renewable energy plays a role I  mentioned the hydrogen Partnerships that  we have signed which will then be  implemented in projects and investment  for producing hydrogen just to name a  few I think it is worth to look at the  fact sheets that we are publishing where  all the different projects are are  summarized and this shows the width of  the investment but also shows the  Strategic direction of travel  thank you very much indeed factions were  also a joint price statement have been  published as we were speaking here I see  no further questions at this stage so  thank you very much uh to the president  and to Mr chairperson and have a good  evening  thank you

